# Changuito repos

Land work in `tote-hq/solana` or `tote-hq/stellar`. Do not open it against forks (`raptor0929/changuito`, `Simonethg/changuito`). Read `git remote -v` before editing.

| Repo | What it owns | Shop deploy |
|---|---|---|
| `tote-hq/solana` | Solana escrow and wallet | `sol.changuito.me` |
| `tote-hq/stellar` | Stellar escrow and wallet | `ste.changuito.me` |

`www.changuito.me` is `apps/landing`, the same site from either repo. `app.changuito.me` is the shop the person uses: promote shared app behavior there. `sol` and `ste` are the same app with that repo's chain wired in.

A change for one chain stays in that repo. App behavior is written once and shipped to every deploy.
